    <id>cryptoinvestmenttracker</id>
    <name>Crypto Investment Tracker</name>
    <summary>Track your crypto investments with live Binance prices</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Track cryptocurrency investments across multiple portfolios.

- Multiple portfolios (e.g. by month, strategy)
- Live prices from Binance (USDT pairs)
- Per-coin and per-portfolio profit/loss
- Per-user data, stored in Nextcloud's database
- Auto-refresh every 30s

Ported from the standalone WinForms app of the same name.
    ]]></description>
